t saved value is the previous request's deadline,\nwhich by then is expired, so the next request to land on that thread failed with\na 504 having spent none of its own budget. Reproduced against a real instance:\n/trackedEntities with fields=* returned 504 after ~1.1s against a 10s budget,\nonly once the pool had been in use for a while.\n\nClears instead of restoring. The pool is private to TrackedEntityAggregate and\nevery task sets its own deadline, so a thread never holds one worth keeping.\nAlso wraps the empty branch of conditionalAsyncFetch, which ran unwrapped and so\ninherited whatever deadline and MDC the thread already had.\n\nThis matters most for the callers with no deadline at all, the data sync job and\nthe SMS listener, which must stay unbounded rather than inherit an export budget.","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"e96d03a34282108fa080729c96f4bd70b3014e50","tree_id":"2cb3e21881011a2422082082c541261001c3b1b7","timestamp":"2026-09-01T09:00:25Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/